# Aiven CA certificate placeholder
# 1. In Aiven console → mysql-683a80a-dancedreck456-dead.k.aivencloud.com → Show CA certificate → Download
# 2. Save as my-app/ca.pem (same folder as Dockerfile.vercel)
# 3. Dockerfile.vercel:4 already sets MYSQL_ATTR_SSL_CA=/app/ca.pem and .dockerignore keeps it
# 4. git add my-app/ca.pem && git commit -m "feat: add Aiven CA" && git push → Vercel auto-redeploy
# If you skip CA, leave MYSQL_ATTR_SSL_CA empty in Vercel env and test — some Aiven projects work without verify
